  "details": "The recent Quest 2 update that brings legs to Meta's avatars is a clear sign that the \"Body Pose Estimation\" showcased in this video (https://youtu.be/QI4aMf-244A) will come on the Quest 3 and hopefully on Quest 2 as well. I bet all Quest and PC VR users with not FBT would like to use it with VRChat. Please prepare the game for it and hopefully soon we can see almost everyone in \"FBT\" (or BPE) around in VRChat. The level of immersion that will bring to the game is gonna be huge!",
